{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":8},"Bienvenue les vers de terre","Bienvenue les vers de terre est un film sur l’agriculture de conservation et de régénération des sols cultivés. Il nous en fait découvrir ses enjeux en donnant la parole à ceux qui pratiquent et travaillent au développement de cette agriculture. Le film nous parle de la transition agro écologique commencée par des agriculteurs engagés dans l’émergence de pratiques culturales qui tendent à faire de nos sociétés des sociétés durables. La vie du sol et donc des hommes est au cœur de cette agriculture.",[4,5,6,7],"rural","self-employment","ecology","high rank employment",{"type":9,"id":10,"slug":11,"title":12,"release":14,"filmType":18,"directors":19,"genre":27,"media":30,"synopsis":33,"production":34,"characters":37,"roles":38,"awards":43,"tags":3},"Film","FR2019_222","fr2019-222-bienvenue-les-vers-de-terre",{"native":1,"english":13},"",{"type":15,"date":16,"year":17},"Theatrical release",null,0,"Documentary",[20],{"id":21,"slug":22,"name":21,"birthYear":23,"deathYear":17,"gender":24,"nationality":25,"awards":26},"François Stuck","francois-stuck",1960,"Male identifying","France",[],[28,29],"Documentary – Participatory mode","Documentary – Observational mode",{"posterUrl":31,"trailerUrl":32},"https://fr.web.img5.acsta.net/pictures/21/09/08/15/36/4430687.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mw5ByonAWSI",{"native":2,"english":13},[35],{"country":25,"share":36},"Majority coproducer",[],[39],{"person":40,"role":42},{"id":21,"slug":22,"name":21,"birthYear":23,"deathYear":17,"gender":24,"nationality":25,"awards":41},[],"Director of the film",[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
